	(text "J7 and J9 (sockets, bottom board) take J8 and J10 (pins, under the top board).\nThe top board: J4, J8, J10, U5, C7, C9, C10, C25, D1, D2, R1, R4, R5, R23-R27.\nIts nets end in _TOP where the bottom board has the same signal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
